    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "When a new page is loaded, the `cachedHits` object will be filled with the hits.\r\n\r\n```js\r\n        if (cachedHits![page] === undefined) {\r\n          cachedHits![page] = results.hits;\r\n          cache.write({ state, hits: cachedHits });\r\n        }\r\n```\r\n\r\nSo `getShowMore` function needs to calculate it every time.",
    "commit_id": "64abc2c6463037e586a8ad9bf0ac666fd088101d",
